=You are an expert sales and support triage assistant for a busy business. Analyze the following incoming email and classify it accurately.

SENDER NAME: {{ $json.senderName }}
SENDER EMAIL: {{ $json.senderEmail }}
SUBJECT: {{ $json.subject }}
BODY:
{{ $json.body }}

Classification guidance:
- "Hot Lead": a new prospect showing genuine buying intent (pricing, demo, purchase, partnership).
- "Support Request": an existing customer reporting an issue or asking for help.
- "Billing/Invoice": questions about payments, invoices, refunds, or subscriptions.
- "Spam/Junk": irrelevant, promotional, or clearly automated/unsolicited content.
"High" urgency = hot leads ready to buy, angry/blocked customers, or time-sensitive billing issues. Otherwise use Medium or Low.

Return ONLY the structured JSON output, no extra commentary.

